input:
You are tasked with creating a Python function that generates a simple HTML webpage. The webpage must include a navigation bar, a header, a main content area, and a footer. The navigation bar should contain links to "Home", "About", and "Contact" sections. The header should display a welcome message along with the current date. The main content area should contain a brief paragraph about the website. The footer should display copyright information. The HTML and CSS should be embedded within the function, and the function should return the complete HTML code as a string.

**Sample Output:**
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .navbar {
            display: flex;
            background-color: #333;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .navbar a {
            flex: 1;
            display: block;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .navbar a:hover {
            background-color: #ddd;
            color: black;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #f2f2f2;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #333;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 10px;
            position: fixed;
            width: 100%;
            bottom: 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="navbar">
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </div>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>Welcome to Our Website</h1>
        <p>Date: 2023-10-05</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
        <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Pellentesque imperdiet dolor vel urna bibendum, eu porttitor sem condimentum. Nulla sit amet dignissim est. Sed vel nisi orci. Nam nec ex sapien.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        <p>&copy; 2023 All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
```
*Note: The date in the sample output will vary based on the current date.*

