    "name": "John",
    "age": 30,
    "children": [
        {
            "name": "Jane",
            "age": 10
        },
        {
            "name": "Doe",
            "age": 7
        }
    ],
    "address": {
        "street": "123 Main St",
        "city": "Anytown"
    }
}
```

**Sample Output:**
```
7
```

